# INVWINPF.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: the locations'
# pick list on a tree longer than its seek goes, with the rooms of
# TEST/mkrooms.sh.  Move on Crate, the tree's last row, opens the pick
# list where the seek for Crate's room gave up; ENTER there asks before
# choosing that row, N keeps the dialog, and ESC moves nothing.  Move
# again, HOME and ENTER choose the top level without a question.  The
# end by Exit.
# TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINPF.SNP is its snapshot.
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER
K ALT-L B END
S CRATE
K ALT-C M
S MISSPICK
K ENTER
S ASK
K N
S KEPT
K ESC
S UNMOVED
K ALT-C M HOME ENTER
S MOVED
K ALT-F X
